# Carbon: Carbon language design documents (carbon-lang); requirements/languages/carbon.md
name     carbon
keyword  package library import api fn var let class interface impl as return if else while for in
keyword  break continue match case default returned base extend abstract virtual partial private
keyword  protected self Self choice namespace where
type     i8 i16 i32 i64 u8 u16 u32 u64 f32 f64 bool String auto
builtin  true false Print
line-comment   //
string   ''' '''  : escapes multiline
string   " "      : escapes
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
